boushi\"","textMapHash":2012586034,"text":"Hello— Mon-Mon—","nextNodeIds":[722610103]},{"nodeId":722610103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":513918514,"text":"...","nextNodeIds":[722610104]},{"nodeId":722610104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":354477834,"text":"Argh, seems like the adeptus isn't at home...","nextNodeIds":[722610105]},{"nodeId":722610105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":1111274402,"text":"Let's not be impolite to the adepti, now.","nextNodeIds":[722610106]},{"nodeId":722610106,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":3968435074,"text":"Paimon, what are adepti?","nextNodeIds":[722610107]},{"nodeId":722610107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3986351562,"text":"Hmm... They're very special people... Or very special animals?","nextNodeIds":[722610108]},{"nodeId":722610108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":848167202,"text":"Like Kichiboushi?","nextNodeIds":[722610109]},{"nodeId":722610109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":980200906,"text":"Uh, not exactly! They have mystical powers...","nextNodeIds":[722610110]},{"nodeId":722610110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":1209421882,"text":"They can \"kapow\"? Then, Kichiboushi also adeptus.","nextNodeIds":[722610111]},{"nodeId":722610111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":415635034,"text":"Um, adepti are much more ancient, and they have a certain... Prestige? Dignity?","nextNodeIds":[722610112]},{"nodeId":722610112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":3010437986,"text":"Oh. Then Kichiboushi, not adeptus. Ioroi is adeptus!","nextNodeIds":[722610113]},{"nodeId":722610113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":3499307546,"text":"Ugh, this is pretty hard to explain.","nextNodeIds":[722610114]},{"nodeId":722610114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"Traveler","textMapHash":2699383674,"text":"The adepti are ancient powers who defend Liyue.","nextNodeIds":[722610115]},{"nodeId":722610115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":1454634434,"text":"Kichiboushi understands. Ioroi protects Chinju Forest, so not adeptus.","nextNodeIds":[722610116]},{"nodeId":722610116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":388516402,"text":"Paimon's pretty sure that's not how it works, but if it clears up any misunderstandings...","nextNodeIds":[722610117]},{"nodeId":722610117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":4038282146,"text":"But since we've got this adeptus' abode in front of us, let's take a picture of Kichiboushi right here!","nextNodeIds":[722610118]},{"nodeId":722610118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":3160,"speakerName":"\"Kichiboushi\"","textMapHash":828407754,"text":"Mm! Kichiboushi, pose for picture!","nextNodeIds":[722610119]},{"nodeId":722610119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"Paimon","textMapHash":1696778,"text":"Good Kichiboushi!","nextNodeIds":[]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7226101,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIGPLHEJH":"QUEST_GUIDE_LAYER_SCENE","GGJOHCAJAPP":0,"HFNCMGLBNGO":"","IDLNFDCEJLG":"QUEST_GUIDE_AREA_STYLE_DEFAULT","KCFINIEBBBG":0,"KEDGDANLBHP":"","KNMAMMFJAOB":"QUEST_GUIDE_STYLE_POINT","LNHLPKELCAL